  "plain": "A researcher named Filippo Biondi, who says he has found huge structures beneath the Khafre pyramid at Giza in Egypt, tells Michels that at the point where his signal cuts off, deep underground, there is something he is not yet revealing. He says only, \"There is something.\" He speaks as one of the people who did the 2025 work, and it ties to his wider claims of tubes and tunnels under the Giza plateau, which if true would mean the pyramids sit on far more than anyone has mapped."
